"shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"pGwrPSAlwMvEnOsFHqB72Q","review_id":"2I1Qch3snZ-C2soKpJZFFw","date":"2017-11-14T21:59:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9300777316093445,"text_excerpt":"I've drove by this place multiple times and said I wanted to check it out. It's had a nice facade and is the first coffee shop I seen in Gentilly so I figured why not support. I was pleasantly surprised to see how nice and spacious it was inside as well as the wide variety of coffee and pastry options! The cashier was nice enough to run through ingredients of different beverages since I was indecisive. I choose the Pontilly frappe for my first time. It's a mix of mocha, caramel & toffee nut which might be my new favorite. As I'm sipping downy frappe I'm anticipating my next visit. I'll definitely be back!"},{"business_id":"pGwrPSAlwMvEnOsFHqB72Q","review_id":"irtt_9RNm1Rsp1NBWRprZQ","date":"2017-06-10T04:42:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9275733232498169,"text_excerpt":"I love this coffee shop! The service is great. There are tons of pastry, coffee, and drink options! The coffee and espresso beans taste better than Starbucks and are stronger. The ambiance and the architecture are so unexpectedly vibrant and jazzy and just so lovely! Don't be fooled by the outside which is more simple and in line with the look of most stores on the street - the interior decoration is really inviting. It is clean and meticulous and pretty organized especially to say that we've been visiting since the first week it was open. I love the cause behind the Pontilly franchise and the way they cater to their customers. Thanks for bringing this establishment to Gentilly/New Orlean..."},{"business_id":"pGwrPSAlwMvEnOsFHqB72Q","review_id":"LNTTMlPR0-nTNhGSZH4J_w","date":"2017-10-16T11:38:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9272783398628235,"text_excerpt":"Best coffee shop in gentilly. I love pontilly coffee I go every morning and I'm still trying new things on the menu. I've never been disappointed. The coffee is great almost like district donuts coffee and way better than pjs. They serve hot sausage breakfast items in the morning! Who does that? Apparently me. The big biscuit with hot sausage is amazing. Idk who's back there making these biscuits but they are amazing. Then they have this loyalty program for people like me who come all the time and I'm pretty close to my free coffee. I could go on and on about great things about this coffee shop but definitely pop in if you can. The staff is super nice they know most of their customers. Wh..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"pGwrPSAlwMvEnOsFHqB72Q","photo_id":"VFTQy6ZTJy-6IbQZ-7CQXA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/VFTQy6ZTJy-6IbQZ-7CQXA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9646596908569336},{"business_id":"pGwrPSAlwMvEnOsFHqB72Q","photo_id":"7_ADYhZJXoaunSSBWyPZWg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7_ADYhZJXoaunSSBWyPZWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9019120931625366},{"business_id":"pGwrPSAlwMvEnOsFHqB72Q","photo_id":"gYRAOanJPD_iR8SHwjj8bA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gYRAOanJPD_iR8SHwjj8bA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8359420299530029},{"business_id":"pGwrPSAlwMvEnOsFHqB72Q","photo_id":"dS3j3P_iYGl_Cuo9keuA6w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dS3j3P_iYGl_Cuo9keuA6w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8208467960357666}]},"notebook_case":null}
